{
  "id": "vector_addition",
  "title": "Vector Addition",
  "description": "Calculate the resulting vector when adding two coplanar vectors using trigonometric methods. Supports calculation of resultant magnitude and angles between vectors and resultant using the cosine and sine rules.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Vector Addition Calculator\n\nAdd two coplanar vectors using trigonometric calculation with the cosine and sine rules.\n\n**Vector Quantities:** Can be used for forces, velocities, or any other vector quantities.\n\n**Formulas:**\n- Resultant magnitude: FR = √(F₁² + F₂² - 2·F₁·F₂·cos(180° - θ))\n- Angle to vector 1: α = sin⁻¹(F₁·sin(180° - θ) / FR)\n- Angle to vector 2: β = sin⁻¹(F₂·sin(180° - θ) / FR)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "vector1_magnitude",
          "label": "Vector 1 Magnitude",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3,
          "unit": "units"
        },
        {
          "id": "vector2_magnitude",
          "label": "Vector 2 Magnitude",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 8,
          "unit": "units"
        },
        {
          "id": "angle_between",
          "label": "Angle Between Vectors",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 80,
          "unit": "degrees"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "resultant_magnitude",
          "label": "Resultant Magnitude",
          "formula": "Math.sqrt(inputs.vector1_magnitude**2 + inputs.vector2_magnitude**2 - 2*inputs.vector1_magnitude*inputs.vector2_magnitude*Math.cos((180-inputs.angle_between)*Math.PI/180))",
          "unit": "units",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "angle_to_vector1",
          "label": "Angle to Vector 1",
          "formula": "Math.asin(inputs.vector1_magnitude*Math.sin((180-inputs.angle_between)*Math.PI/180)/Math.sqrt(inputs.vector1_magnitude**2 + inputs.vector2_magnitude**2 - 2*inputs.vector1_magnitude*inputs.vector2_magnitude*Math.cos((180-inputs.angle_between)*Math.PI/180)))*180/Math.PI",
          "unit": "degrees",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "angle_to_vector2",
          "label": "Angle to Vector 2",
          "formula": "Math.asin(inputs.vector2_magnitude*Math.sin((180-inputs.angle_between)*Math.PI/180)/Math.sqrt(inputs.vector1_magnitude**2 + inputs.vector2_magnitude**2 - 2*inputs.vector1_magnitude*inputs.vector2_magnitude*Math.cos((180-inputs.angle_between)*Math.PI/180)))*180/Math.PI",
          "unit": "degrees",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}